## NAMED GATE CHANGE (GATE INTEGRITY rule)
scripts/qa-asr.py duration cap: the syllable regex is Cyrillic-only, so for
lang=ja the cap degenerated to 1.3 s for every clip and flagged whole words
as duration-suspect — the false-positive class recorded as D-011 (82/100 of
run-3 ja flags). The cap now counts Japanese morae (kana incl. ー/sokuon,
small kana absorbed). This relaxes ONLY the duration dimension for ja, to the
correct unit; phoneme round-trip, hallucination and vocalization reasons are
unchanged. No test was edited or skipped anywhere in this lane.

